     [38;5;246mCSV: account_id,cents with header, no total row. JSON: {day, rows[], total_cents}. Exact; clean to parse.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Formatted decimals
     [38;5;246m"10.50" strings, CSV gets a trailing total row mirroring the emailed text. Human-friendly, parser-hostile.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Both columns
     [38;5;246maccount_id,cents,amount in CSV; both keys in JSON. No conversion needed by anyone, redundant data.[39m
